How many lines of symmetry does this square have?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) rectangle (3.6,3.6);
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]

What is the order of rotational symmetry of this parallelogram?
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\draw (0,0) -- (4.4,0) -- (5.8,2.5) -- (1.4,2.5) -- cycle;
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
